OL,3,GNEWSAZoo denies safety charges after   
OL,4,Avisitor death                          
OL,6,FA wildlife park has denied health and  
OL,7,Fsafety charges after a 73-year-old     
OL,8,Fwoman died in a fall at the attraction.
OL,10,FThe Combe Martin Wildlife and Dinosaur 
OL,11,FPark, in Devon, has been charged with  
OL,12,Ffive counts under the Health and Safety
OL,13,Fat Work Act following the incident in  
OL,14,FAugust 2023.                           
OL,16,FExeter Magistrates' Court heard the    
OL,17,Fwoman was on a family visit to the     
OL,18,Fattraction when she fell on a very     
OL,19,Fsteep slope from the car park area.    
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
