OL,3,GNEWSAZoo denies safety charges after   
OL,4,Avisitor death                          
OL,6,FThe legal team for the zoo denied all  
OL,7,Ffive charges and a trial is set to take
OL,8,Fplace at a later date. The park closed 
OL,9,Fearlier in November, after 40 years,   
OL,10,Fdue to rising operating costs.         
